 security\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"content-grid\">\n            \n            <main class=\"main-column\">\n                <div class=\"hero\">\n                    <div class=\"hero-left\">\n                        <div class=\"placeholder placeholder-logo\" title=\"[Firefox Logo: centered]\"></div>\n                        <h1 class=\"hero-title\">Privacy and security</h1>\n                        <p class=\"hero-subtitle\">Learn how to protect your privacy and secure your data.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"hero-right\">\n                        <button class=\"btn-download\">Download Firefox</button>\n                        <div class=\"hero-links\">\n                            <a href=\"#\">Systems and Languages</a>\n                            <a href=\"#\">What's New</a>\n                            <a href=\"#\">Privacy</a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"tabs\">\n                    <div class=\"tab active\">All articles and threads</div>\n                    <div class=\"tab\">Tracking protection</div>\n                    <div class=\"tab\">Encryption</div>\n                    <div class=\"tab\">Security</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"article-list\">\n                    \n                    <div class=\"article-item\">\n                        <div class=\"article-icon\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n                        <div class=\"article-content\">\n                            <h2 class=\"article-title\">Use built-in VPN in Firefox</h2>\n                            <p class=\"article-desc\">Learn how to activate and use the built-in VPN feature in Firefox to protect your browsing.</p>\n                            <div class=\"article-meta\">\n                                <span>Firefox</span>\n                                <span class=\"icon-pencil\">&#9998;</span>\n                                <span class=\"meta-date\"><strong>Last updated:</strong> 1 day ago</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"article-item\">\n                        <div class=\"article-icon\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n                        <div class=\"article-content\">\n                            <h2 class=\"article-title\">Common Myths about Private Browsing</h2>\n                            <p class=\"article-desc\">Learn more about common misconceptions about Private Browsing in Firefox.</p>\n                            <div class=\"article-meta\">\n                                <span>Firefox</span>\n                                <span class=\"icon-pencil\">&#9998;</span>\n                                <span class=\"meta-date\"><strong>Last updated:</strong> 11/3/25</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"article-item\">\n                        <div class=\"article-icon\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n                        <div class=\"article-content\">\n                            <h2 class=\"article-title\">Avoid and report Mozilla tech support scams</h2>\n                            <p class=\"article-desc\">Mozilla does not provide telephone support and does not charge for software downloads, upgrades or technical help. Learn more.</p>\n                            <div class=\"article-meta\">\n                                <span>Firefox, Firefox for Android, Firefox for iOS,...</span>\n                                <span class=\"icon-pencil\">&#9998;</span>\n                                <span class=\"meta-date\"><strong>Last updated:</strong> 2/3/25</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"article-item\">\n                        <div class=\"article-icon\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n                        <div class=\"article-content\">\n                            <h2 class=\"article-title\">Insecure connection password warning in Firefox</h2>\n                            <p class=\"article-desc\">Firefox will show you a \"connection is not secure\" warning message when a website login page is insecure and information could be stolen.</p>\n                            <div class=\"article-meta\">\n                                <span>Firefox</span>\n                                <span class=\"icon-pencil\">&#9998;</span>\n                                <span class=\"meta-date\"><strong>Last updated:</strong> 3/19/26</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"article-item\">\n                        <div class=\"article-icon\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n                        <div class=\"article-content\">\n                            <h2 class=\"article-title\">Third-party trackers</h2>\n                            <p class=\"article-desc\">Learn about cross-site (third-party) cookies that collect information to track your browsing, which are used on many websites.</p>\n                            <div class=\"article-meta\">\n                                <span>Firefox</span>\n                                <span class=\"icon-pencil\">&#9998;</span>\n                                <span class=\"meta-date\"><strong>Last updated:</strong> 10/26/24</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"article-item\">\n                        <div class=\"article-icon\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n                        <div class=\"article-content\">\n                            <h2 class=\"article-title\">Does Firefox share my location with websites?</h2>\n                            <p class=\"article-desc\">Learn what information Firefox sends to websites about your location and how to use and manage location-aware features of your browser.</p>\n                            <div class=\"article-meta\">\n                                <span>Firefox</span>\n                                <span class=\"icon-pencil\">&#9998;</span>\n                                <span class=\"meta-date\"><strong>Last updated:</strong> 3/22/26</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"article-item\">\n                        <div class=\"article-icon\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n                        <div class=\"article-content\">\n                            <h2 class=\"article-title\">Configure DNS over HTTPS protection levels in Firefox</h2>\n                            <p class=\"article-desc\">DNS over HTTPS (DoH) is a recommended feature that enhances privacy. Learn more about the DoH protection levels you can configure in Firefox settings.</p>\n                            <div class=\"article-meta\">\n                                <span>Firefox</span>\n                                <span class=\"icon-pencil\">&#9998;</span>\n                                <span class=\"meta-date\"><strong>Last updated:</strong> 3/27/25</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"article-item\">\n                        <div class=\"article-icon\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n                        <div class=\"article-content\">\n                            <h2 class=\"article-title\">Enhanced Tracking Protection in Firefox for desktop</h2>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </main>\n\n    